title: LilGuy_Respite
---
<<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaNeutral>>
<<show SceneSampleEvents Nubs nubsNeutral>>
His electric eyes wander and become mesmerized by the sky's dusky colors.
<<if visited("Bad_Outcome") == true>>
    Nubs: Today is still better than all the other days I have lived in the lab.
<<endif>>
<<if visited("Bad_Outcome") == false>>
    <<show SceneSampleEvents Nubs nubsHappyArms>>
    Nubs: Today is the best day ever.
<<endif>>
<<declare $lilday = 0>>
<<jump LilGuy_Day>>
===


title: LilGuy_Day
---
-> What are your days usually like? <<once>>
    <<set $lilday += 1>>
    Nubs: Undergoing 20-30 tests a day to assess my durability. As the greatest product ever developed by AGENTS, I need to withstand drowning, poison, plasma, and firestorms. 
    <<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaSurprised>>
    Nubs: In case the place I am stored in explodes from an incoming stealth missile.
    Nubs: Then I get squeezed back into a capsule that is smaller than the pod you freed me from.
    <<show SceneSampleEvents Nubs nubsWorried>>
    Nubs: It was kinda hard to breathe in there, now that I think about it.
    <<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaNeutral>>
    Luna: That's inhumane. Isn't this against a law or something?
    <<show SceneSampleEvents Nubs nubsLoading>>
    Nubs: Title XVI, Section 23, Clause 8: It is not considered worker or animal cruelty if the organism was not constructed with a bladder.
    <<show SceneSampleEvents Nubs nubsNeutral>>
    Nubs: I do not have one. So I suppose there really is no logical reason for me to leave my capsule, after all.    
    <<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaNeutralArms>>
    Luna: What a convenient loophole…
    <<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaNeutral>>
    <<jump LilGuy_Day>>
-> What made today so great? <<once>>
    <<set $lilday += 1>>
    Nubs: Meeting you. And getting to see how humans live.
    // If player’s $badend score is >= 5, then show this line of text and expression below:
    <<if $badend >= 5>>
        <<show SceneSampleEvents Nubs nubsAngry>>
        Nubs: Even if you are intolerable and inhospitable at times…
        <<show SceneSampleEvents Nubs nubsNeutral>>
    <<else>>
    // If player’s $badend score is <=4, then continue with the below:
        Nubs: You have a good life.
        <<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaNeutralArms>>
        Luna: Don't bullshit me.
        Luna: There's nothing “good” about my life at all.
        Nubs: You do not have to be poked and stuffed into a capsule, only for the same thing to happen to you the next day. You can do whatever you want, with unrestricted access to the city.
        <<show SceneSampleEvents Nubs nubsHappy>>
        Nubs: And you'll use that access to take me back to my master, which you promised you would do once we completed this delivery!
        Luna: …
        <<show SceneSampleEvents Nubs nubsNeutral>>
        Nubs: You are not a prototype. You are…an original. 
        <<show SceneSampleEvents Nubs nubsWorried>>
        Nubs: At least you have a purpose…
    <<endif>>
// When the two questions above have been played through, reveal this choice to continue with the main story:
<<if $lilday == 2>>
    -> What is your purpose?
        Luna: So what is your purpose? Why were YOU created?
        <<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaNeutralArms>>
        Luna: And don't give me that firewall crap.
        <<show SceneSampleEvents Nubs nubsConfused>>
        Nubs: But, I really cannot access those files…
        Luna: Then what do YOU want your purpose to be?
        <<show SceneSampleEvents Nubs nubsNeutral>>
        Nubs: …!
        Luna: Okay, so you can't access it. So what? What do YOU want to do?
        <<show SceneSampleEvents Nubs nubsWorriedArms>>
        Nubs is genuinely stumped by my question. Nothing in his database is able to retrieve a clear answer.
        <<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaNeutralShy>>
        Luna: I know I'm supposed to drop you off at your master's, but…it doesn't seem like you even wanna go back to pokes and firestorms.
        Luna: You…deserve to live…        
        <<show SceneSampleEvents Nubs nubsNeutral>>
        Nubs: Luna…
        <<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaShy>>
        Luna: (Ugh, why am I even saying this? It's like I'm trying to give myself a pep talk.)
        ///////////////// Is it possible to stop the current music track so that there’s complete silence?
        <<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaSurprised>>
        <<show SceneSampleEvents Nubs nubsNeutralArms>>
        ???: You deserve JAIL TIME.
<<endif>>
<<jump MaxxIntro>>
===




title: MaxxIntro
---
// Play JunkYard music track
<<play SceneSampleEvents junkyard>>
<<enter SceneSampleEvents Maxx>>
<<show SceneSampleEvents Maxx maxxNeutral>>
???: Straight to jail.
<<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaAnnoyedArms>>
A douchebag with an augmented glass jaw rolls up next to me on his bulky motorbike. The thing has been customized to bits to show off—and not to drive.
I press my weight deeper into my motorbike, ready to bounce at any moment.
Luna: Who the hell are you?
<<show SceneSampleEvents Maxx maxxIntrigued>>
Maxx: The one true ascended adonis of AGENTS, Maxx.
Maxx: Lanklets refer to me as their Chief Product Officer, but our elevated CEO prefers the new-age term “Disciple” for his executive C-suite.
Nubs: That's the guy who named me T.A.B!
Luna: …Makes sense.
<<show SceneSampleEvents Maxx maxxNeutral>>
Maxx: I finally found you after combing through AGENTS highway footage.
Maxx: You've been driving around town with company property. 
Nubs: …
Maxx: If you're a smart girl, you'll hand over that pillbug and continue on with your extremely jester life.
<<show SceneSampleEvents Nubs nubsWorriedArms>>


-> Over your gigachad body.
    <<set $goodend += 1>>
    <<show SceneSampleEvents Maxx maxxIntrigued>>
    Maxx: Flame me all you want, but everyone wishes they had my body and brain chemistry.
    Maxx: My jaw is made from Area 27 diamonds. No amount of mewing and semaglutides could ever get to my level.
-> And what do I get in return for handing him over?
    <<set $badend += 1>>
    <<show SceneSampleEvents Maxx maxxIntrigued>>
    Maxx: Good strategy! I admire your business mindset.
    Maxx: But the only ROI you'll get is a life behind bars for stealing AGENTS property!
-> And if I don't?
    Maxx: A life behind bars for stealing AGENTS property!
<<jump MaxxThreat>>
===




title: MaxxThreat
---
Nubs: …
<<show SceneSampleEvents Maxx maxxIntrigued>>
Maxx: Don't act innocent, little pillbug. I overheard your non-compliant conversation with the girl.
Maxx: You, having a life of your own?
Maxx: Once I take you back, you'll be torn apart for the next prototype! Though given your recent acts of sacrilege, I doubt we'll salvage anything from your existing parts.
<<show SceneSampleEvents Maxx maxxNeutral>>
Maxx: As for you.
His eyes and glass jaw glow as his internal system scans me and my motorbike over.
Maxx: Let's see here…
Maxx: A fake license plate. Multiple accounts of speeding. And stealing intellectual property from an AGENTS lab.
Luna: (He's confusing me with the person who stole Nubs from the lab…)
Maxx: Not only will I suspend your SL0P account, but I'll also process a warrant for your arrest and assign a CENTURY'S worth of debt to your bank account!
<<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaAnnoyedShy>>
Luna: (Shit, I'm already swimming in debt! I can't afford any more…!)
Maxx: Buuuuut if you let the pillbug go now, I GUESS I'll let you and your busted bike continue to use the SL0P app.
<<show SceneSampleEvents Maxx maxxIntrigued>>
Maxx: And, as an add-on, I'll drop the debt charges. Because I'm SUCH a forgiving god.
<<show SceneSampleEvents Nubs nubsWorriedArms>>
Nubs: …
<<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaNeutralShy>>
Luna: (This might be my last chance to bargain…)
<<jump MaxxChoices>>
===




title: MaxxChoices
---
-> Take the deal.
    <<jump BadEnding1>>
-> Don't take the deal.
    <<set $goodend += 1>>
    Luna: (Do it scared. Even if it fucks me over.)
    <<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaNeutralArms>>
    <<show SceneSampleEvents Nubs nubsNeutralArms>>
    Luna: No deal. I'm keeping him. And his name's Nubs.
    <<show SceneSampleEvents Maxx maxxAnnoyed>>
    Maxx: WHAT? Are you stupid!?
    Nubs: L-Luna! But why—?
    <<show SceneSampleEvents Nubs nubsConfusedWave>>
    Nubs: Ah!
    I scoop him up and ram my foot on my motorbike's pedal.
    // Motorcycle SFX sound
    <<sfx SceneSampleEvents tires>>
    Luna: If you want him, then you're gonna have to get him!
    And with that, I start hauling ass back to Root Town. 
    <<exit SceneSampleEvents Luna>>
    <<exit SceneSampleEvents Nubs>>
-> Tell him you're not the person he's looking for. <<once>>
    <<set $badend += 1>>
    <<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaNeutralArms>>
    Luna: None of this is my fault—because someone else gave me this task. THAT'S the real person you're after.
    Maxx: Doesn't matter. You still unlocked AGENTS-sanctioned property and that's against SL0P app policy.
    <<show SceneSampleEvents Maxx maxxIntrigued>>
    Maxx: And thanks for the tip! I'll make sure to lock BOTH of you up!
    <<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaAnnoyedArms>>
    Luna: (Shit, that didn't work.)
    Nubs: Luna…
    <<jump MaxxChoices>>
-> Flirt and distract him before you make a run for it.
    <<show SceneSampleEvents Maxx maxxIntrigued>>
    Maxx: Thanks, but you're not my type.
    <<exit SceneSampleEvents Luna>>
    <<exit SceneSampleEvents Nubs>>
    Maxx: Refusing women, sports, and beer are what separate me from the average man who's ladaring. Dating would keep me from being my one true, elevated self.
    Maxx: And there's no ROI in love.
    <<show SceneSampleEvents Maxx maxxNeutral>>
    Maxx: …
    <<show SceneSampleEvents Maxx maxxAnnoyed>>
    Maxx: Tch!
    The dumbass was so into himself, making it easy for me and Nubs to escape and leave him in the dust.
    I was already hauling my ass back to Root Town.


<<show SceneSampleEvents Maxx maxxAnnoyed>>
Maxx: Well played. But it's not over.
Maxx: Didn't think I'd need to use this…
<<fadeOut SceneSampleEvents>>
// Stop Junk Yard music track
<<stop SceneSampleEvents junkyard>>
////////////// Play Beep SFX
<<jump LilGuyBrainwashed>>
===




title: BadEnding1
---
The stakes are too high. I don't want to owe anyone anything. Not anymore.
<<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaNeutralArms>>
<<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaWorriedArms>>
Luna: Fine.
<<show SceneSampleEvents Maxx maxxIntrigued>>
<<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaWorriedWave>>
Nubs: L-Luna, no!
I toss Nubs over to the overgrown gigachad. The creature is just a prototype, after all.
Maxx: Smart girl. I knew you'd make the right choice.
Nubs: N-No…!
Maxx: To the scrapyard, pillbug!
////////////////// Beep SFX
<<show SceneSampleEvents Nubs nubsNeutralWave>>
Nubs: !!!
<<show SceneSampleEvents Nubs nubsAgents>>
Nubs: …
<<exit SceneSampleEvents Maxx>>
<<exit SceneSampleEvents Nubs>>
I block out the gigachad's cackling as he rides away with the city's most dangerous weapon. 
I sigh, turning to look at Frisscity's glistening cityscape one last time before I ride off as if nothing ever happened.
Because nothing did.
Tonight was just another night of trying to survive.
<<fadeOut SceneSampleEvents>>
<<wait 2>>
<<fadeIn SceneSampleEvents>>
///////////////////////// Play the Error of Our Ways music track
// Show a screen with THE END text, and an option to Load Game or Return to Title Screen
// Play “To Be Continued” music track
<<fadeOut SceneSampleEvents>>
===




title: LilGuyBrainwashed
---
//////////////////// Play Deadroom track
// Show the Bridge environment bridge asset, TBD if we’ll have an on the bridge background asset or not!
<<wait 2>>
<<fadeIn SceneSampleEvents>>
<<wait 2>>
I speed my way onto The Bridge, weaving around self-driving cars and corporate megabuses that shuttle underpaid workers back home.
It's just a few more miles before I reach Root Town, where Frisscity's high-tech gadgets lose signal—and hold no power over me.
<<enter SceneSampleEvents Luna>>
<<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaNeutral>>
<<enter SceneSampleEvents Nubs>>
<<show SceneSampleEvents Nubs nubsAgents>>
Nubs: …
Luna: W-What the hell?!
Luna: Nubs!? Hey, buddy, wake up!
A hypnotic swirl dominates Nubs's screenface. His body freezes in place, clinging onto the nape of my neck as I race past another bus.
The more I stare at the spiral, the more I feel…enticed by it.
I quickly blink the sensation away, shaking my head and turning back to the road I'm racing down.
Luna: (I can't look at that thing. It's like it's drilling a hole into my mind…)
Suddenly, a new voice takes over Nubs.
// Do NOT call Maxx’s sprite to appear
Maxx: There you are.
<<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaAnnoyed>>
Luna: (Shit, he can track me…?!)
//////////////////// Play SFX Maxx motorcycle sound
A motor mixed with ego and neon particles roars behind me in the distance.
Maxx: Won't be long before I catch up. 
My breath stalls. Sweat starts beading at the back of my neck.
Luna: (I knew there was a cost to shoving it to AGENTS and that overgrown gigachad.)
Luna: (But I'm totally fucking screwed!)
Luna: (Was this choice even worth it…?!)
<<jump Cybergulls>>
===




title: Cybergulls
---
//////////////// Play SFX Cybergull M 
<<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaSurprised>>
Luna: !!!
The squawk of a cybergull splits the sky. I look up, keeping my foot on the accelerator.
<<if $withCog == true>>
// Enter Cybergull with cog on
<<enter SceneSampleEvents Cybergull>>
<<show SceneSampleEvents Cybergull cybergullCog>>
Luna: (It's that gull from the dumpster…)
Luna: (He thugged it out and now he's able to fly with that cog…)
FX gulls short version
<<endif>>
<<if $withCog == false>>
// Enter Cybergull without the cog on
<<enter SceneSampleEvents Cybergull>>
<<show SceneSampleEvents Cybergull cybergullCogless>>
Luna: (It's that gull from the dumpster…)
<<endif>>
//////////////// SFX Cybergull S 
He lets out another loud, electrifying battle cry that rings out across The Bridge. 
// Exit Cybergull
<<exit SceneSampleEvents Cybergull>>
Shadows materialize in the distance, and I begin to see a whole horde of cybergulls flap towards us.
Luna: (HE'S A GANG LEADER?!?!)
<<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaNeutral>>
Luna: (Wait…)
The Bridge is a prime roost for cybergulls, who love to swoop down and swipe whatever shines the brightest.
Luna: (This could actually be my key to ditching Maxx for good!)
//////////////////// Play SFX Maxx motorcycle sound
<<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaSurprised>>
<<enter SceneSampleEvents Maxx>>
<<show SceneSampleEvents Maxx maxxNeutral>>
Suddenly I hear tires screeching and then, in a blink of an eye, I see Maxx riding right beside me on his shining stallion of a trashpile.
Maxx: Boo.
<<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaAnnoyed>>
Luna: …
We're both speeding down the road, neck and neck.
<<show SceneSampleEvents Maxx maxxAnnoyed>>
Maxx: Why aren't you pulling over? I GOT you. You're going to JAIL!
<<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaNeutral>>
Luna: Not yet.
// SFX motorcycle tires
<<sfx SceneSampleEvents tires>>
<<exit SceneSampleEvents Luna>>
<<exit SceneSampleEvents Nubs>>
I veer off, making a hard left turn onto another highway onramp. It's the turn only a Root Town local would know.
Maxx: Dammit!
Maxx doesn't make the turn in time and continues straight…right into the growing horde of cybergulls.
<<fadeOut SceneSampleEvents>>
<<jump Cybergull_CG>>
===


title: Cybergull_CG
---
////////////////// Continue Deadroom music track
///////////////// Show Maxx and Cybergulls CG. Do not call any character sprites during this time.
<<background SceneSampleEvents maxxCG>>
<<wait 2>>
<<fadeIn SceneSampleEvents>>
<<wait 2>>
//////////////// Play SFX Cybergull Battlecry sound effect
I stop my bike at the edge of the shoulder lane, watching as the horde of birds swell before descending upon him and the highway below.
Maxx: No no no no NOOOOO!
The birds are relentless. 
Pecking, ripping, and ransacking anything that glows, which includes both Maxx and his precious state-of-the-art junkyard motorcycle.
Maxx: Not the face! Not the JAW!! Now the JAWWWWW!!
I flinch and look away, refusing to watch the gulls tear Maxx's prized possession and his ego away from him, limb from limb.
Maxx: AHHHHHHHHHHHHRRRRGHHHH!!!
The cybergulls slowly disperse back into dusk, leaving tokens of their appreciation in the form of noxious droppings spittled across the concrete.
Whatever is left of Maxx and his motorcycle remains on the highway, like roadkill.
<<fadeOut SceneSampleEvents>>
// Dismiss CG
<<jump BridgeResolution>>
===




title: BridgeResolution
---
//////////////// Play Ascension Mellow music track
<<wait 2>>
<<fadeIn SceneSampleEvents>>
<<wait 2>>
<<enter SceneSampleEvents Luna>>
<<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaNeutral>>
<<enter SceneSampleEvents Nubs>>
<<show SceneSampleEvents Nubs nubsAgents>>
We make it safely to the outskirts of Root Town. I park on the side of the road. Frisscity's lights glitter from the other side of the bridge.
<<if $withCog == true>>
    //////////////// Play SFX Cybergull S
    <<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaSurprised>>
    // Enter Cybergull with cog on
    <<enter SceneSampleEvents Cybergull>>
    <<show SceneSampleEvents Cybergull cybergullCog>>
    The cybergull gang leader descends down from the skies, hovering over my place on the road. The massive cog twinkles in the night sky.
    <<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaNeutral>>
    Luna: It's him…
    He watches me carefully through his scarred eye…
    …Before deciding to poop on me.
    <<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaAnnoyedShy>>
    Luna: S-Shit!
    Literally. Happy with his revenge, the cybergull departs into the darkness.
    Luna: Ughhhh, grosssss…!
    This stuff isn’t gonna come out of my jacket.
    //////////////// Exit Cybergull
    <<exit SceneSampleEvents Cybergull>>
<<endif>>


A sharp noise buzzes from Nubs and I turn to look at him.
<<show SceneSampleEvents Nubs nubsWorried>>
Nubs: H-Huh?
<<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaHappy>>
Luna: Nubs! You're back!
<<show SceneSampleEvents Nubs nubsWorriedArms>>
Nubs: What happened…?
Luna: Shit. CRAZY shit. And a whole lotta shit. 
<<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaNeutral>>
Luna: What do you remember?
Nubs: I remember Maxx demanding for my custody. Threatening you with the full force of the AGENTS Legal team and Frisscity police force. And you, driving away with me.
<<show SceneSampleEvents Nubs nubsWorriedWave>>
Nubs: Which is what I don't understand!
<<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaNeutral>>
Luna: What do you mean?
<<show SceneSampleEvents Nubs nubsWorriedArms>>
Nubs: Why did you decide to take me across The Bridge? To keep me?
Luna: …
<<if $goodend >= 4>>
    <<jump GoodPath>>
<<else>>
    <<jump BadEnding2>>
<<endif>>
===




title: BadEnding2
---
Luna: Delivering you to Root Town was worth a lot on the SL0P app, remember? I have to keep you close if I wanna get paid.
<<show SceneSampleEvents Nubs nubsWorried>>
Nubs: Oh…
Luna: And when Maxx cornered me, I knew I'd lose everything. And that's not an option for me. 
Luna: (I have to survive.)
<<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaAnnoyedArms>>
Luna: A job's a job, and I gotta finish it. And to be honest, I don't think you're even worth all the trouble I've been through tonight.
Nubs: R-Right. This was all just a monetary transaction. Of course…
<<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaAnnoyedShy>>
Luna: Today's been a huge pain in the ass…
Luna: (And a reminder of how much I hate Frisscity.)
Luna: Let's just get this over with.
<<fadeOut SceneSampleEvents>>
<<wait 2>>
// I imagine just the dialogue box, with no sprites appearing
I drive off into Root Town to complete the delivery. The SL0P app tells me to drop off the experiment near Val's corner store, which seems suss at first…
But I don't care. It's not worth my time to think about it right now.
I'm just trying to survive.
<<fadeIn SceneSampleEvents>>
///////////////////////// Play the Error of Our Ways music track
//////////////////////// Show a screen with THE END text, and an option to Load Game or Return to Title Screen
<<fadeOut SceneSampleEvents>>
===




title: GoodPath
---
Luna: You're worth a lot, so it was better to keep you close.
<<show SceneSampleEvents Nubs nubsWorriedArms>>
Nubs: Oh…
<<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaHappy>>
<<show SceneSampleEvents Nubs nubsNeutralArms>>
Luna: I'm joking, dummy! 
<<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaNeutral>>
Luna: Nothing good would be waiting for you back at AGENTS. You don't want to go back to assholes like Maxx and a life of poking, do you?
<<show SceneSampleEvents Nubs nubsWorriedArms>>
Nubs: No, I don't want to…
<<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaNeutralShy>>
Luna: Honestly, I haven't felt this way in a long time. It almost makes me…giddy? I don't know how to describe it.
<<show SceneSampleEvents Nubs nubsNeutral>>
Nubs: Luna…
Luna: Now, as for where to take you…


//If player selected Tell the truth and explain your situation from Intro.yarn file, show this:
<<if $tellTruth == true>>
    //////////////// Set Lil Guy’s expression to neutral
    <<show SceneSampleEvents Nubs nubsAngry>>
    Nubs: I do not want to go back. And I do not want to get dropped off.
    <<show SceneSampleEvents Nubs nubsNeutral>>
    Nubs: I want to stay with you.
    <<show SceneSampleEvents Nubs nubsWorried>> 
    Nubs: If that is okay…
    <<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaHappyShy>> 
    Luna: Finally! A choice.
    <<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaNeutralArms>> 
    Luna: But you'll have to get permission from my roommates first.
    Luna: I know one's a solid yes to keeping you. As for the other girl, you'll have to make your case to her.
    Luna: IF she even gets past the fact you can talk…
//If player selected Lie and say the requestor is its master from the Intro.yarn file, show this:
<<else>>
    Luna: I…might've lied to you when I said the delivery's customer was your master.
    <<show SceneSampleEvents Nubs nubsAngry>>
    Nubs: Yeah, I kinda figured. I scanned you in secret once my lie detector battery was recharged.
    <<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaAnnoyedShy>>
    Luna: Rude.
    <<show SceneSampleEvents Nubs nubsNeutral>>
    Nubs: But I do not want to go back. And I do not want to get dropped off.
    Nubs: I want to stay with you.
    <<show SceneSampleEvents Nubs nubsWorried>> 
    Nubs: If that is okay…
    <<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaNeutralArms>>
    Luna: You'll have to get permission from my roommates first.
    Luna: I know one will vote yes, for sure. As for the other girl, well. You'll get the chance to make your case.
<<endif>>


<<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaNeutralArms>>
<<show SceneSampleEvents Nubs nubsNeutral>>
Luna: (The girls are in for one wild ride tonight…I hope they don't kick me out for good.)
We take one last look at Frisscity together. Nubs looks just as mesmerized as he was when we were on the other side.
Luna: Hey. What do you think about the views from here?
Nubs: It's…different.
<<show SceneSampleEvents Nubs nubsHappy>>
<<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaHappyArms>>
Nubs: But I think it looks cooler from this side.
Luna: Me too.
<<fadeOut SceneSampleEvents>>
<<jump TheArrival>>
===




title: TheArrival
---
<<wait 2>>
<<fadeIn SceneSampleEvents>>
<<wait 2>>
/////////////// Play Lounge Lizards music track
/////////////// Show girls’ apartment background asset
I park my motorbike on the curb with Nubs on my shoulder. A few jumps through some overgrown weed patches, and I'm finally at the doorstep of the abandoned warehouse I call home.
<<enter SceneSampleEvents Luna>>
<<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaNeutral>>
/////////////// Do NOT show Nubs’s sprite yet. 
Nubs: What is this place made of?
I hear Nubs from over my shoulder. Something keeps flapping and tickling the back of my neck, but I don't think too much about it. The weight of tonight has me completely trashed.
<<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaNeutralArms>>
Luna: A few train cars we cobbled together after Frisscity closed our nearby train station. They said there was “too much riffraff from this side of town.” Or whatever shit excuse that means.
Nubs: …
Luna: (Well, here goes nothing…)
I take a deep breath and step inside.
Luna: Yo, I'm back.
<<enter SceneSampleEvents Kaya>>
<<show SceneSampleEvents Kaya kayaHappy>>
Kaya: Hey, welcome back—
<<if $withCog == true>>
<<show SceneSampleEvents Kaya kayaNeutral>>
Kaya: Ew, what happened to you?!
She gestures at the cybergull droppings and the sickening odor that emanates from my clothing.
<<endif>>


<<show SceneSampleEvents Kaya kayaAngry>>
Kaya: And what did you just bring inside?
<<enter SceneSampleEvents Nubs>>
<<show SceneSampleEvents Nubs nubsAngryEars>>
Luna: His name's Nubs and he's a cyberpet.
Nubs: We have been over this. I am not a pet!
Luna: And apparently he's gotten sassier, too.
Luna: (Why is he sounding more like me?)
<<show SceneSampleEvents Kaya kayaNeutral>>
Kaya: I-It can talk?!
<<enter SceneSampleEvents Nat>>
<<show SceneSampleEvents Nat natNeutral>>
Nat: Oooh, a talking cyberpet? Finally, the zillionaires are working on something that's actually USEFUL!
<<show SceneSampleEvents Kaya kayaAnnoyed>>
Kaya: No pets. We've been through this before, like when Nat wanted to adopt that tripod robo-cat.
Nat: Awww, but he was such a cutie pie! And cats are like one of the 2,224.5 things I'm not allergic to.
Kaya: How are you gonna pay for this thing, anyway? You're already waaaaay behind on rent.
<<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaAnnoyedArms>>
Luna: Thanks for the reminder…
Kaya: You'll need a crate for that thing, too. And a leash that won't pull on those big ears, too.
<<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaSurprisedArms>>
<<show SceneSampleEvents Nubs nubsHappyEars>>
Luna: Ears…?
Luna: W-What the hell!? He didn't look like that a few minutes ago, I swear!
Kaya: SEE? We can't trust him. He's gonna grow, and shed, and leave molts everywhere. Can't have that in my witch's brew.
Nubs wiggles off my shoulder and onto the living room floor, his new set of ears twitching.
Nubs: My systems have advanced and I'm evolving into a new, more improved form!
<<show SceneSampleEvents Nat natCute>>
Nat: Ooooh, what a cute lil boi in his cute little form! I say YES to keeping him!
Kaya: And I vote NO.
<<show SceneSampleEvents Luna lunaNeutralArms>>
Luna: Called it.
